Package: local-parental-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Local Parental Control maintainers
Depends: systemd, apparmor
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Local device and application time limits for Linux users
 A local-only root daemon that restricts login hours and daily device time,
 measures configured application usage, and enforces the configured limits.
 Administration is performed through the lpctl command-line tool.
